Room A
Room A. The bakery. The shop is to the east.
You can see a bench (on which are a white loaf, a rye loaf, a plain roll and a sweet roll) and an oven (which is empty) here.
> oven
The oven is empty.
> takings
Sold: 0 loaves. Burnt: 0. Takings: 0.
Orders filled: 0. That was a quiet day.
[]
The bakery had a quiet day.
Open orders: 3.
> orders
Orders: rye, sweet, white.
First: white. Last: sweet.
> price rye loaf
The rye loaf is 4 coins.
RYE is a special.
> price sweet roll
The sweet roll is 2 coins.
Rolls sell in the morning.
> price white loaf
The white loaf is 3 coins.
White sells best.
> eat white loaf
(first taking the white loaf)
It is raw dough.
